(7157505, 1098012, 108069, '<td valign="top">Best in show in my opinion. Lovely colors, and so smooth. Crisp detail and very clean. I''m not a very "technical" photo person, but the technical precision of this has resulted in an extremely soothing photo, which is not typical for a macro shot. Very well done.</td>', 'Best in show in my opinion. Lovely colors, and so smooth. Crisp detail and very clean. I''m not a very "technical" photo person, but the technical precision of this has resulted in an extremely soothing photo, which is not typical for a macro shot. Very well done.', '2014-01-14 21:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7157510, 1098150, 108069, '<td valign="top">Creative focal plane makes this quite cool. Rich brown beans vs. man''s steel. Like the worn texture in the spoon as well. Nicely done.</td>', 'Creative focal plane makes this quite cool. Rich brown beans vs. man''s steel. Like the worn texture in the spoon as well. Nicely done.', '2014-01-14 21:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7157543, 1097811, 108069, '<td valign="top">Really well done. Like the S curve to this, and the colors. Well done on keeping all the bits in focus as well.</td>', 'Really well done. Like the S curve to this, and the colors. Well done on keeping all the bits in focus as well.', '2014-01-14 22:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7157560, 1098121, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Perfectly done.</td>', 'Great photo. Perfectly done.', '2014-01-14 22:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7157563, 1097719, 108069, '<td valign="top">Macros come in many shapes, but one breed that really stands out to me is when the mundane is so close and vivid it can instill a sense of panic. This is immediate, in our faces. And it''s an... apple. Excellently done.</td>', 'Macros come in many shapes, but one breed that really stands out to me is when the mundane is so close and vivid it can instill a sense of panic. This is immediate, in our faces. And it''s an... apple. Excellently done.', '2014-01-14 22:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
