(7159745, 1098187, 108069, '<td valign="top">Really cool image. I like the murky haze and soft, graduated tones. Nice one.</td>', 'Really cool image. I like the murky haze and soft, graduated tones. Nice one.', '2014-01-19 12:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7159749, 1097939, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Paper-thin focal plane shown off well here on a knife point. The soft, muted tones throughout are quite nice, as they bleed from the knife point outward, and to be honest I think the border might even detract from that a bit as it creates an outer bit of contrast that interrupts the flow. But what the hell do I know anyway? Would be nice on a wall.</td>', 'Nice idea. Paper-thin focal plane shown off well here on a knife point. The soft, muted tones throughout are quite nice, as they bleed from the knife point outward, and to be honest I think the border might even detract from that a bit as it creates an outer bit of contrast that interrupts the flow. But what the hell do I know anyway? Would be nice on a wall.', '2014-01-19 12:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7159753, 1098055, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautifully processed to get the rich but muted tones. Quite a nice piece of art here.</td>', 'Beautifully processed to get the rich but muted tones. Quite a nice piece of art here.', '2014-01-19 13:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
